id: pm-ul5lph
title: Harden Bash completion literals and large-workspace search normalization
description: PR 1279 review found unescaped static Bash completion values and argument-spread score extrema that fail for large result maps. Also align search decomposition metadata with current SDK ownership.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
