acceptance_criteria: Real Bash regression proves no command execution; 200000-score regression normalizes correctly; search item scope metadata matches SDK implementation; exact coverage and required gates pass
parent: pm-yh8r
severity: high
repro_steps: Generate Bash completion with a command substitution in a static value and invoke that completion branch; normalize more than 200000 matching search scores.
resolution: "Escaped both Bash expansion stages for static and dynamic values, normalized search scores without variadic calls, and reconciled current SDK task scope"
expected_result: Completion treats supplied values as data and search normalization supports large result sets without changing public contracts
actual_result: Six real Bash routes preserve literal values with no injected execution; 200000-score regression passes; 9059 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage plus mandatory static gates pass
