comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-19T17:41:53.086Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status completion injection and normalizeScoreMap searches inspected; existing completion and relevance owners describe prior delivered features. No matching open defect found. Open and in_progress inventories checked; this child records new PR 1279 findings without reopening completed decomposition."
  "2026-09-19T17:44:11.964Z","harness:codex","Red-first evidence: both new tests failed before fixes: real Bash emitted INJECTEDBACKTICK and score normalization threw RangeError at 200000 entries. A single source-escaping layer is insufficient because compgen -W expands again. Static values now escape wordlist metacharacters then source interpolation; dynamic values use Bash printf %q per word. All six real-shell input routes pass, retaining literal variables, quotes and backslashes. Extrema now scan using two-argument Math.min/max, preserving NaN and equal-score semantics."
  "2026-09-19T17:48:39.556Z","harness:codex",Focused linked verification passed all completion and search-cache tests; four TypeScript projects and touched-file ESLint pass. Repeated disposable-workspace lifecycle acceptance passes all 17 steps after the security changes. Full exact coverage and mandatory static pipeline are being rerun for the final reviewed head.
  "2026-09-19T17:53:14.644Z","harness:codex","Full coverage retry encountered host disk-quota error -122 on temporary writes, cascading into fixture initialization and lock failures; no coverage receipt was produced. Re-running the unchanged regression assertions under the established /var/tmp acceptance root after static checks complete. This failed host run is not counted as passing evidence."
  "2026-09-19T18:05:34.933Z","harness:codex","Final full coverage passes after host-safe scratch relocation: 9059 tests in 718 files; statements 64761/64761, branches 49447/49447, functions 13457/13457, lines 61971/61971. Exact 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts. No production assertion, coverage exclusion or limit was weakened."
  "2026-09-19T18:13:32.704Z","harness:codex","Final mandatory quality:static pipeline passed with zero clones, complete module/export/public-member documentation coverage, SDK contract snapshot unchanged, package and command boundaries, context budgets, performance floors, graph composition and record integrity green. Current-branch linked tests and full 9059-test exact coverage pass. All three accepted review findings are implemented; hosted validation will run on the consolidated revision."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-19T17:57:49.367Z","harness:codex",Static gate caught 121 tests in tests/unit/sdk against the 120-file ceiling. Relocated the input-boundary regression into the existing tests/unit/sdk/security directory; assertions and gate ceilings are unchanged. Full verification uses /var/tmp for host-safe scratch allocation.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-19T17:46:50.688Z","harness:codex","Bash compgen -W performs word expansion on its input after the generated source has already been parsed. Protect both boundaries: quote static wordlist metacharacters before source quoting, and encode dynamic words with printf %q. A substring assertion cannot detect this; execute the actual generated function in a clean Bash process with inert stderr-only attack probes."
